From: Gentoo local configuration
Subject: [PATCH] openrc: avoid real and virtual display-manager collision

OpenRC rejects a dependency graph where display-manager and xdm are both
real services from gui-libs/display-manager-init and virtual services
provided by soniclogin.  Use the real soniclogin service name directly.

--- a/services/openrc/soniclogin.in
+++ b/services/openrc/soniclogin.in
@@ -24,1 +24,0 @@
-    provide xdm display-manager
